{"game": "terminull-brigade", "language": "english", "appid": 3104410, "month": "2025-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1760572800, "end_date": 1761263999, "month_true_total": 49, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 02:32:06 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "207300280", "author": {"steamid": "76561198230755888", "personaname": "Not Sentro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198230755888/", "num_games_owned": 414, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1893, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1893, "last_played": 1761127320, "avatar": "bc10be6a669ed681ed521a250c31316affc14156"}, "language": "english", "review": "If u want to keep your sanity DO NOT PLAY THIS GAME. I played during season 0 and had little to no issues, some lag every now and then, come back to season 1 and the opening titles are all slide shows and the games servers seemed to have offed themselves, quite disappointing cause I had hope for this game, but alas its just backed by another greedy company who just wants you to open your wallet only, while not having the mindset or decency to keep their servers running. 2 out of 10 wish was better :/", "timestamp_created": 1761127509, "timestamp_updated": 1761127509, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207274853", "author": {"steamid": "76561199878661391", "personaname": "Cleome", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199878661391/", "num_games_owned": 18, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3145, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3145, "last_played": 1763328307, "avatar": "cca61a27f55da1001a977059b02c206aa5f96a2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "where do i even begin... lets get the good out of the way first because i don't have much to say about that; the core gameplay loop is fun. that's all. now, even though the core gameplay loop is fun, the reason i can never recommend this game to anyone in its current state is because the stuttering is ridiculous. i find it unbelievable and unacceptable that the game has continued on in this state for so long without the devs even addressing this issue, let alone fixing it. completely unacceptable. the stuttering NEEDS to be addressed by the devs. until then it will remain a game with a good core idea nerfed by useless devs that dont care.\n\nedit: dropped. devs obviously do not care about their playerbase at all. hard skip.", "timestamp_created": 1761089947, "timestamp_updated": 1770912035, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207247920", "author": {"steamid": "76561199467115073", "personaname": "Sedooqi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sadiqhak/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1166, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played": 1768342995, "avatar": "3ef1ae895a8de884d2ec8d3713253eedf5aaa78f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Besides the stutter issuees its a reeally fun rogue like game", "timestamp_created": 1761064028, "timestamp_updated": 1761064028, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", 